OL,3,AHow fields of Fermanagh helped Daisy
OL,4,AEdgar-Jones prepare for her latest film
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Daisy Edgar-Jones is no
OL,7,Fstranger to Ireland, having spent five
OL,8,Fmonths in the country filming hit drama
OL,9,FNormal People which was released in
OL,10,F2020.
OL,12,FBut it was actually fields in County
OL,13,FFermanagh, where some of her family
OL,14,Flive, that helped her prepare for the
OL,15,Frole of beloved character Elinor
OL,16,FDashwood in Jane Austen's Sense and
OL,17,FSensibility, some 20 years before.
OL,19,FHer mother is from County Down and
OL,20,FEdgar-Jones spent her childhood roaming
OL,21,Ffields in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790069048
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHow fields of Fermanagh helped Daisy
OL,4,AEdgar-Jones prepare for her latest film
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I remember big long summers when I was
OL,7,Fvery young in Fermanagh in the fields
OL,8,Fwhich definitely helped with my Sense
OL,9,Fand Sensibility journey because I was
OL,10,Fdoing a lot of the similar wandering
OL,11,Faround, with not much to do, under the
OL,12,Fbig sky and I love being here," she
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
